SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5  charge
    pe   4
    C(4) 5e-4
    Mn   1e-3

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -steps 10.0 in 100
    -cvode false

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -molalities CO3-2 HCO3- CO2
    -totals C
